  m_Name: FieldCommanderPoweredArmor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Field Commander in Powered Armor
  role: 1
  description: 'The Field Commander sealed in powered armor. Lead from the front
    still gives friendly soldiers within 15 m +15% accuracy, and Armor Level 2 halves
    rifle fire and shrugs off pistols and grenades, so the Commander can stand much
    closer to the fight. The cost is speed: 6 m a move (12 m sprinting), so it has
    to plan ahead to keep the army inside its aura. A Commander: it fills your required
    Commander slot.'
